'''Evangelist Cat''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 2.0 Update#Version 2.0.4 Update|Version 2.0.4]]. In the '''Japanese''' version of the game, it was unlocked via [[Serial Codes|serial codes]] that were found exclusively on [[PONOS Corporation|PONOS]] employee business cards, however, this method no longer works due to this function being removed in [[Version 4.3 Update|Version 4.3]]. In the '''Korean''' version, a time-limited event would give players a 10% chance to obtain said unit. As of now, it is only available in [[The Battle Cats Unite!]] and replaces [[Filibuster Cat X (Special Cat)|Filibuster Cat X]] as it is the clear reward from clearing [[Cats of the Cosmos]]. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.6 Update|Patch 1.0.6]], it was given the ability to target [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]] enemies.

