==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.6 Update|Version 2.2.6]], Evangelist Cat had a 78-second attack rate and a 666.6-second recharge.
*The "legends" that Evangelist Cat's description mentions are the [[PONOS Corporation|PONOS]] employees who had the serial code on their business cards.
*Though Evangelist Cat is unobtainable in the English version, he could be unlocked via hacking but lacks an entry in the [[Cat Guide]].
*Evangelist Cat is one of the cheapest Uber Rare Cats in the game, only being behind [[Koneko (Uber Rare Cat)|Koneko]], [[Metal Maiden Koneko (Uber Rare Cat)|Metal Maiden Koneko]] and the unobtainable unit [[Cheetah Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Cheetah Cat]].
*Evangelist Cat and [[PPT48 (Uber Rare Cat)|PPT48]] are the only Uber Rare Cats that have unusual level-up costs.
*Evangelist Cat's design was used as a base for [[Filibuster Cat X (Special Cat)|Filibuster Cat X]]. The two also have similar roles and abilities, but Evangelist Cat freezes all enemies except for [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] enemies whereas Filibuster Cat X only freezes [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemies.
*Evangelist Cat is the only non-[[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] to be obtained via serial code. It and [[Giga-Nyan Rex (Uber Rare Cat)|Giga-Nyan Rex]] are also the only legitimately obtainable Uber Rare Cats to not drop from the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Cat Capsules|Rare Cat Capsule]].
*Evangelist Cat's design is inspired from [[wikia:dragonball:Frieza|Frieza]]'s True Form from ''Dragon Ball Z''. Its attack also references Frieza's [[wikia:dragonball:Death Ball|Death Ball]].
**Evangelist Cat also bears some resemblance to [[bulbapedia:Mewtwo (Pokémon)|Mewtwo]].
*Filibuster Cat's goggles resemble the goggles that [[wikipedia:Cyclops (comics)|Cyclops]] wears.
*In The Battle Cats Unite!, this unit's Normal and Evolved Forms' names are "Filibuster Cat α" and "Filibuster Cat β" respectively.
*Though it is unlocked via clearing Cats of the Cosmos, it is possible for it to get up to level 40+20 via save file editing in the Nintendo Switch port.

